WEBVTT

01:00.100 --> 01:02.900
=Daughter of Fortune=

01:02.900 --> 01:05.460
(Adapted from the novel
"Phoenix Palace Dream" by Lan Jiujiu)

01:05.540 --> 01:08.460
=Episode 14=

01:13.200 --> 01:13.920
Your Majesty,

01:14.200 --> 01:15.799
may I have my death-exemption medal now?

01:16.879 --> 01:17.640
No.

01:22.280 --> 01:24.159
How exactly did I offend him again?

01:29.400 --> 01:30.560
What's wrong, Young Lady?

01:34.200 --> 01:35.599
I'm really exhausted.

01:37.159 --> 01:38.890
The rumors say
he's moody and unpredictable.

01:39.250 --> 01:40.599
Turns out they're completely true.

01:41.200 --> 01:42.890
He changes his face faster
than turning a page.

01:43.360 --> 01:45.040
Serving the ruler
is like serving a tiger.

01:47.239 --> 01:49.959
(But I truly don't have much time left.)

01:55.560 --> 01:56.640
Phoenix Perches Parasol,

01:56.640 --> 01:57.519
Long Night Bright.

01:57.520 --> 02:00.239
Those two lines were the final words
of the Chifeng Army's commander.

02:00.840 --> 02:02.359
How does Shen Zhinian know them?

02:05.770 --> 02:07.079
Shen Zhinian once mentioned to me

02:07.079 --> 02:08.879
that her maternal family
lives in Chizhou.

02:09.240 --> 02:10.360
Send people

02:10.560 --> 02:11.759
to bring them to the capital.

02:13.240 --> 02:13.680
Yes.

02:17.100 --> 02:19.180
(Ten taels)

02:23.599 --> 02:26.199
Why did Mother only send
a few dozen taels this time?

02:26.900 --> 02:28.240
How is this supposed to be enough?

02:29.170 --> 02:30.879
Once Young Master
enters official service,

02:31.040 --> 02:33.639
Eldest Young Lady, you won't
have to worry about silver anymore.

02:36.000 --> 02:37.319
Shen Nanqiao!

02:42.479 --> 02:43.120
Lu.

02:43.130 --> 02:45.760
Did you manage to obtain that item
at Jinsong Pavilion last night?

02:46.000 --> 02:47.740
Is Duke Zhen
finally going to value you now?

02:47.759 --> 02:48.390
Wretched woman!

02:48.580 --> 02:50.560
Do you have any idea
how badly you've ruined me?

02:50.840 --> 02:52.680
Thirteen thousand taels of silver!

02:53.000 --> 02:54.190
What am I supposed to do now?

02:55.199 --> 02:57.479
What thirteen thousand taels?

02:57.719 --> 02:59.039
Why are you still pretending?

02:59.199 --> 02:59.800
Tell me.

03:00.080 --> 03:01.240
Did you set me up on purpose?

03:02.479 --> 03:04.280
From the peach tree to Jinsong Pavilion,

03:04.360 --> 03:05.719
there was never any hidden master.

03:06.360 --> 03:07.759
You deliberately harmed me.

03:08.120 --> 03:08.879
No, that's not it.

03:09.039 --> 03:09.759
Lu,

03:10.000 --> 03:11.080
listen to me.

03:11.560 --> 03:12.800
There really was

03:13.000 --> 03:15.159
a mysterious recluse who told me.

03:15.610 --> 03:17.520
Otherwise, how could I possibly
have helped you

03:17.520 --> 03:18.890
gain the favor of Dowager Consort Liu?

03:19.039 --> 03:20.000
If I believe you again,

03:20.680 --> 03:23.039
I'll probably end up dead
without a burial.

03:23.919 --> 03:24.599
Lu!

03:24.960 --> 03:25.479
Lu!

03:26.039 --> 03:26.680
Don't panic.

03:26.919 --> 03:28.039
What exactly happened?

03:28.120 --> 03:30.879
I truly regret not chasing
after Shen Zhinian back then

03:30.879 --> 03:31.879
and leaving with her.

03:34.479 --> 03:35.560
Lu Jianglin,

03:36.180 --> 03:37.759
I treated you with nothing but kindness,

03:37.759 --> 03:39.120
yet you resent me?

03:39.280 --> 03:40.960
Shen Zhinian betrayed you,

03:41.360 --> 03:42.719
and you still can't let her go.

03:44.479 --> 03:46.840
What's so special about her?

03:51.240 --> 03:52.280
Has there been any movement

03:53.120 --> 03:54.000
from Duke Zhen's side?

03:54.010 --> 03:55.990
Jiang Fu only returned
to the residence this morning.

03:56.000 --> 03:57.830
Less than one hour later,
she was carried back out.

03:57.840 --> 03:59.319
They say she received fifty lashes.

03:59.479 --> 04:00.719
She was beaten half to death

04:01.080 --> 04:02.520
and ordered to repay the silver.

04:03.090 --> 04:04.080
What about Lu Jianglin?

04:04.240 --> 04:05.599
He went to the Duke Ding Manor,

04:06.039 --> 04:07.240
but for some reason,

04:07.400 --> 04:08.879
Duke Ding drove him out.

04:09.680 --> 04:10.520
How strange.

04:10.759 --> 04:12.439
Who exactly is Lu Jianglin working for?

04:13.080 --> 04:14.000
How did he learn

04:14.000 --> 04:15.400
about the Chifeng Army tally?

04:15.719 --> 04:17.399
As long as he keeps running around,

04:17.680 --> 04:19.720
he's bound to leave traces behind.

04:19.780 --> 04:22.279
(Tinglan Palace)

04:22.279 --> 04:24.000
By the Mandate of Heaven,

04:24.160 --> 04:25.879
the Emperor decrees.

04:26.079 --> 04:28.079
To Shen Zhinian of the Shen family,

04:28.240 --> 04:29.839
graceful and virtuous,

04:30.000 --> 04:31.759
refined and dignified in conduct,

04:32.040 --> 04:34.519
you are hereby
promoted to Lady of Beauty.

04:34.839 --> 04:36.199
Respect this decree.

04:36.680 --> 04:37.959
Congratulations, Lady Shen.

04:43.600 --> 04:46.360
His Majesty already said last time that
he would promote Your Ladyship to Lady of Beauty.

04:46.360 --> 04:48.120
Now the decree has finally arrived.

04:48.680 --> 04:48.959
Come.

04:49.480 --> 04:51.040
Bring the gift I prepared.

04:51.319 --> 04:52.520
We're going to visit Lady Liu.

04:52.530 --> 04:54.519
Young Lady,
why are you still bringing her gifts?

04:54.519 --> 04:55.800
She nearly got you killed.

04:56.040 --> 04:58.240
Don't forget, she saved you
in the Cold Palace.

04:58.680 --> 05:00.279
What if she was the one who poisoned us?

05:00.360 --> 05:01.360
It wasn't her.

05:02.040 --> 05:03.399
Even if she wanted me dead,

05:03.400 --> 05:05.510
she would've first investigated
my crimes thoroughly.

05:05.920 --> 05:08.199
Besides, I'm not only visiting her
to give thanks.

05:08.279 --> 05:09.079
It's also because

05:09.079 --> 05:11.040
she's the longest serving consort
in the palace

05:11.600 --> 05:12.839
aside from the Empress.

05:13.240 --> 05:14.160
I want to ask her

05:14.160 --> 05:16.720
about His Majesty's taboos.

05:19.120 --> 05:20.000
Shen Zhinian,

05:20.439 --> 05:21.600
what is the meaning of this?

05:22.680 --> 05:25.079
I came to thank Your Ladyship.

05:25.759 --> 05:27.040
To thank Your Ladyship

05:27.040 --> 05:27.879
for saving Handan.

05:28.360 --> 05:29.519
You're thanking me

05:29.519 --> 05:31.560
with something this worthless?

05:32.160 --> 05:35.199
I know that Your Ladyship
enjoys boundless honor and wealth.

05:35.399 --> 05:36.639
Naturally, nothing is lacking.

05:37.240 --> 05:40.439
I heard Your Ladyship
was once bold and carefree,

05:40.660 --> 05:41.959
and especially fond of archery.

05:42.560 --> 05:43.319
So...

05:44.000 --> 05:45.639
You've certainly done your research.

05:46.360 --> 05:48.000
But keep your little schemes to yourself.

05:48.639 --> 05:51.439
I stopped touching bows and arrows
after my coming of age ceremony.

05:52.120 --> 05:53.759
Why care about the opinions of others?

05:54.240 --> 05:56.079
If it's something
Your Ladyship truly loves,

05:56.800 --> 05:58.160
why not take it up again?

06:04.360 --> 06:05.720
I'm not a man.

06:06.199 --> 06:08.079
I won't be fooled by your sweet words.

06:09.160 --> 06:09.920
Speak.

06:10.439 --> 06:12.319
Why exactly did you come to see me?

06:13.160 --> 06:14.360
I wish to know

06:14.920 --> 06:16.240
what taboos His Majesty has.

06:19.759 --> 06:20.680
Shen Zhinian,

06:20.920 --> 06:22.240
you've got some nerve.

06:22.720 --> 06:25.399
You actually dare ask me
how to win His Majesty's favor?

06:26.040 --> 06:27.079
Lives are at stake,

06:27.319 --> 06:29.199
so I beg Your Ladyship to enlighten me.

06:29.560 --> 06:31.560
I will surely
repay the favor in the future.

06:32.500 --> 06:33.970
What do you mean lives are at stake?

06:34.839 --> 06:36.720
Don't tell me you're trying
to save Lu Jianglin?

06:36.720 --> 06:38.000
You still want someone like him?

06:38.600 --> 06:39.519
That's not the case.

06:40.160 --> 06:41.079
Then why?

06:46.319 --> 06:47.680
Since you're unwilling to say,

06:48.040 --> 06:49.199
I won't press further.

06:50.279 --> 06:52.560
But if you think a single bow
will get you your answer,

06:53.000 --> 06:53.879
it won't be that easy.

06:54.319 --> 06:56.439
As long as Your Ladyship
is willing to tell me,

06:56.879 --> 06:58.079
I would do anything.

07:00.600 --> 07:02.720
I don't need you
to risk your life for me.

07:04.560 --> 07:06.720
But since you've gifted me this bow,

07:07.600 --> 07:09.800
I'll give you one chance.

07:14.839 --> 07:16.240
If you can beat me,

07:16.480 --> 07:17.560
I'll tell you.

07:18.079 --> 07:19.199
I'll give you a handicap.

07:19.519 --> 07:20.240
You go first.

07:29.240 --> 07:30.800
You still have time to admit defeat.

07:31.759 --> 07:33.279
Kowtow to me,

07:33.480 --> 07:34.319
then get out.

08:04.240 --> 08:04.800
Your Ladyship,

08:06.319 --> 08:07.120
your turn.

08:21.360 --> 08:23.759
You will personally serve as my target.

08:23.920 --> 08:25.360
Your Ladyship, let me do it instead.

08:36.320 --> 08:37.360
Arrows have no eyes.

08:37.639 --> 08:39.559
Be careful,
or you may not leave here alive.

08:39.759 --> 08:41.320
You still have time to admit defeat.

08:43.200 --> 08:43.879
Your Ladyship,

08:44.360 --> 08:45.120
please.

08:49.879 --> 08:51.960
Do you know that if my arrow
misses by even an inch,

08:52.559 --> 08:53.840
your face will be ruined?

09:10.919 --> 09:11.600
Forget it.

09:11.610 --> 09:13.440
His Majesty's birthday banquet
is approaching.

09:13.759 --> 09:14.840
Bloodshed would be unlucky.

09:15.200 --> 09:16.200
I'll spare you today.

09:16.720 --> 09:18.120
Only this once.

09:19.159 --> 09:20.320
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

09:21.360 --> 09:22.679
The Dowager Consort once told me

09:23.360 --> 09:24.690
that when His Majesty was young...

09:30.159 --> 09:31.720
If I danced in red,

09:31.730 --> 09:32.790
he would give me medicine.

09:32.919 --> 09:33.559
Is that true?

09:34.519 --> 09:35.279
Yes.

09:35.519 --> 09:37.679
I always treated you as a friend.

09:37.799 --> 09:39.960
I even risked execution to come see you.

09:40.360 --> 09:42.440
And you still don't trust me?

09:43.559 --> 09:44.679
His Majesty agreed.

09:45.240 --> 09:46.960
He put on that shameful dance outfit.

09:59.200 --> 10:00.399
Wonderful.

10:01.799 --> 10:03.120
Dance again.

10:03.399 --> 10:04.799
Dance another one. Get up.

10:06.600 --> 10:07.799
Fine.

10:16.480 --> 10:17.919
How boring. Let's go.

10:19.159 --> 10:20.120
Give me the medicine.

10:21.120 --> 10:22.000
What medicine?

10:22.000 --> 10:22.720
Do you deserve it?

10:22.720 --> 10:24.600
The dance ended,
but there was no medicine.

10:25.279 --> 10:26.879
Only humiliation and deception.

10:27.200 --> 10:28.440
So His Majesty

10:28.440 --> 10:29.759
suffered so much as a child.

10:31.399 --> 10:33.120
He's experienced too many betrayals.

10:33.600 --> 10:35.790
That's why it's difficult for him
to truly trust anyone.

10:36.799 --> 10:38.840
It seems I can't obtain
the death-exemption medal

10:39.559 --> 10:41.559
through favor alone.

10:41.960 --> 10:42.960
Then what will you do?

10:46.159 --> 10:48.399
How about we
forget about the death-exemption medal?

10:48.520 --> 10:50.039
Being a favored consort isn't so bad.

10:53.039 --> 10:54.390
Favor is the most unreliable thing.

10:54.799 --> 10:56.279
It can disappear at any moment.

10:56.799 --> 10:57.799
Once favor is lost,

10:58.000 --> 10:59.679
I can't even protect
the people around me.

11:03.600 --> 11:05.960
If favor can't earn me
a death-exemption medal,

11:06.519 --> 11:08.279
then I'll earn it with my own abilities.

11:10.480 --> 11:12.000
Young Lady, you mean...

11:13.320 --> 11:14.770
If I can't become a favored consort,

11:14.960 --> 11:16.320
then become someone

11:16.919 --> 11:18.200
who can work for him instead?

11:18.700 --> 11:19.960
He brought me out of the palace

11:19.960 --> 11:21.879
because I could help cover
for him, didn't he?

11:22.480 --> 11:25.200
That means I can still be useful to him.

11:25.440 --> 11:26.279
Make preparations.

11:26.519 --> 11:27.650
I'm going to see His Majesty.

11:29.600 --> 11:30.120
Your Majesty.

11:31.860 --> 11:32.440
Your Majesty.

11:32.450 --> 11:33.890
Something has happened at Xunlu Pavilion.

11:33.900 --> 11:35.730
Isn't the poetry competition
being held there?

11:36.080 --> 11:36.970
What could've happened?

11:37.080 --> 11:39.080
Ever since this year's
competition began,

11:39.090 --> 11:40.720
Lu Jianglin has always taken first place.

11:41.120 --> 11:43.000
But lately, he's missed
four rounds in a row.

11:43.240 --> 11:44.559
And during those same four rounds,

11:44.559 --> 11:46.759
a brilliant scholar
from Jin suddenly appeared.

11:47.039 --> 11:48.120
Every poem he composed

11:48.440 --> 11:50.600
completely overwhelmed
our scholars of Daliang.

11:51.400 --> 11:52.840
The poetry gathering at Xunlu Pavilion

11:52.840 --> 11:54.780
was established by Your Majesty
as a path for scholars

11:54.799 --> 11:56.520
of humble birth
to enter official service.

11:56.720 --> 11:57.559
Duke Zhen

11:57.700 --> 11:59.960
has secretly tried to sabotage it
all along, but failed.

12:00.519 --> 12:01.799
Yet during this gathering,

12:01.799 --> 12:03.559
many people from Jin suddenly appeared

12:03.960 --> 12:05.919
and suppressed every scholar in Daliang.

12:06.200 --> 12:07.519
A mighty nation like Daliang,

12:07.700 --> 12:09.759
and between one Duke Zhen
and a few poets from Jin,

12:09.759 --> 12:11.000
none of you can handle it?

12:12.440 --> 12:13.279
Sorry to trouble you.

12:13.279 --> 12:14.360
Please announce me.

12:22.480 --> 12:23.519
Lady Shen, please enter.

12:28.399 --> 12:29.279
Why are you here?

12:29.879 --> 12:30.639
Your Majesty,

12:30.639 --> 12:31.879
I had some free time today,

12:31.960 --> 12:33.039
so I made some pastries

12:33.279 --> 12:35.080
and brought them
for Your Majesty to try.

12:35.879 --> 12:36.720
Just now at the door,

12:36.720 --> 12:38.590
I overheard you discussing
the poetry gathering.

12:38.879 --> 12:39.879
I humbly wish

12:40.519 --> 12:41.639
to give it a try.

12:42.320 --> 12:42.960
That's right.

12:43.440 --> 12:45.320
Lady Shen is exceptionally talented.

12:45.600 --> 12:47.799
Those people from Jin
and Hu won't stand a chance.

12:53.840 --> 12:55.200
Take this token

12:55.399 --> 12:56.480
and go to Boyue Pavilion.

12:56.700 --> 12:59.280
Review the winning essays
from previous years at Xunlu Pavilion,

12:59.500 --> 13:00.790
as well as the competition rules.

13:01.700 --> 13:02.890
I obey Your Majesty's decree.

13:06.799 --> 13:07.559
Your Majesty,

13:07.700 --> 13:10.190
are you truly allowing Lady Shen
to participate in the poetry gathering?

13:21.120 --> 13:26.240
♪Broken dreams,
listening to the light rain♪

13:27.960 --> 13:33.200
♪Bitter cold, bringing mist to the eyes♪

13:34.840 --> 13:37.200
♪If we don't meet♪

13:37.400 --> 13:40.640
♪Flowers bloom and fall in shame♪

13:40.840 --> 13:47.360
♪If we meet again,
the peaches will be warm♪

13:47.720 --> 13:54.160
♪Spring breeze passes,
dancing through the years♪

13:54.520 --> 14:00.840
♪Brewing longing,
remembering past lives♪

14:01.360 --> 14:08.040
♪Hard to meet, and just as hard to part♪

14:08.040 --> 14:14.920
♪Who planted the beans
that grew into lotuses?♪

14:15.160 --> 14:21.040
♪Spring breeze passes,
composing the fleeting years♪

14:21.960 --> 14:28.560
♪Clouds on Mount Wu,
no sails on the sea♪

14:28.720 --> 14:35.400
♪Wanting to fold my heart
into a paper kite♪

14:35.680 --> 14:42.120
♪But the ties are too tangled to sever♪
